WEBVTT

00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.880 line:0%
[Episode 10]

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.279 line:0%
Stop.

00:01:49.279 --> 00:01:50.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.160 line:0%
Madam instructed

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.000 line:0%
that upon arrival,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.360 line:0%
all the lamps should be put out.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.080 line:0%
So...

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:56.480 line:0%
Put them out.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:57.960 line:0%
Put out the lamps.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.760 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:05.850 line:0%
please watch your step.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.129 line:0%
-Grand Commander.
-Grand Commander.

00:02:16.129 --> 00:02:16.960 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:17.720 line:0%
Miss Yan

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:18.680 line:0%
has taken an unfamiliar man

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.760 line:0%
to my chamber.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.480 line:0%
She asked us to wait here.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:22.760 line:0%
Mr. Han.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.800 line:0%
Where have you been

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.080 line:0%
hiding all this time?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.860 line:0%
Why are you leaving so soon?

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:31.790 line:0%
Han Shiyuan?

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.379 line:0%
Shiyuan ran away.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.120 line:0%
Are you sure that person is Han Shiyuan?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:44.840 line:0%
It's him.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:46.160 line:0%
That's exactly how he ran away that day.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.320 line:0%
He was wearing the exact

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.120 line:0%
same clothes.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.040 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.280 line:0%
Exactly the same.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.160 line:0%
That day,

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.040 line:0%
you were startled by the fire at the Ming Hall.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.240 line:0%
Plus, it was bright in the east and dark in the west,

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.320 line:0%
and that person headed west.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:55.879 line:0%
That day,

00:02:55.879 --> 00:02:56.720 line:0%
you didn't

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.250 line:0%
see his face clearly at all.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.120 line:0%
It wasn't him?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.460 line:0%
But it was clearly him just now.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.790 line:0%
It was also him that day.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.290 line:0%
The one in the room just now wasn't him,

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.960 line:0%
and it wasn't him that day either.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.480 line:0%
It was his shadow.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:10.640 line:0%
That day,

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.720 line:0%
Lan Guizhou used the shadow

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:13.600 line:0%
to create the illusion that

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.120 line:0%
Han Shiyuan was still in the house.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.400 line:0%
After that, he disguised himself as Han Shiyuan

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:18.860 line:0%
and left, heading west.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.760 line:0%
Coincidentally,

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.480 line:0%
the Ming Hall to the east caught fire,

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.100 line:0%
producing a huge glow

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.700 line:0%
that diverted attention,

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.560 line:0%
resulting in

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.840 line:0%
the witnessing student mistakenly believing

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.170 line:0%
that he was Han Shiyuan.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.600 line:0%
You're making baseless assumptions.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.440 line:0%
On the seventh day of the fifth lunar month,

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.879 line:0%
Shiyuan was clearly inside the house,

00:03:34.879 --> 00:03:36.400 line:0%
and then he left, heading west.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.640 line:0%
The thing is

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.870 line:0%
both you

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:39.680 line:0%
and the student

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.000 line:0%
who witnessed outside

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:41.920 line:0%
indicated that

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.160 line:0%
Han Shiyuan

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:43.720 line:0%
left the house alone.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:44.680 line:0%
You were inside the house.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.560 line:0%
In a situation where the lights were on inside

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.080 line:0%
and it was dark outside,

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.040 line:0%
how could you possibly see

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.500 line:0%
Han Shiyuan heading west?

00:03:49.879 --> 00:03:51.080 line:0%
Miss Yan has a point.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.320 line:0%
With the lights on inside the house,

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.400 line:0%
it's indeed impossible to see what's going on outside.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.720 line:0%
As for why he fabricated the story of

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.200 line:0%
Han Shiyuan still being at the Hongwen Academy

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.080 line:0%
on the night of the seventh day of the fifth lunar month,

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.200 line:0%
that's a question

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.400 line:0%
we should ask this good roommate of his.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.160 line:0%
Take him away.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.880 line:0%
Students, disperse.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:25.800 line:0%
Pan.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.370 line:0%
Thank you so much for today.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.720 line:0%
It was just a small trick,

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.980 line:0%
not worth mentioning.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.000 line:0%
Who exactly is this Pan?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:34.840 line:0%
Look. Madam and he

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.120 line:0%
are chatting and laughing,

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.980 line:0%
as if they're old acquaintances.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.280 line:0%
Miss Yan.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:40.760 line:0%
I have other matters to attend to today,

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:41.920 line:0%
so excuse me for not staying longer.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.320 line:0%
You're leaving already?

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.520 line:0%
I haven't even had the chance

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.780 line:0%
to thank you properly.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.480 line:0%
If it's meant to be, we'll meet again.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.400 line:0%
If you need anything in the future,

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.520 line:0%
feel free to come find me at the Ghost Market anytime.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.440 line:0%
It's a deal.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:55.370 line:0%
Is that so?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.120 line:0%
Yes.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.200 line:0%
Madam has never been

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.730 line:0%
so cheerful in the mansion.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.330 line:0%
Today, we really owe it to Pan

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.370 line:0%
for successfully solving the case.

00:05:32.959 --> 00:05:34.840 line:0%
Are you going to the Imperial Security Bureau without me?

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:36.260 line:0%
What about the interrogation?

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.060 line:0%
Figure something out yourself.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.610 line:0%
What is that about?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.130 line:0%
Grand Commander, we've investigated.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.640 line:0%
That Pan is named Pan Chi.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.540 line:0%
He solved several mysterious cases in Jiangnan.

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.500 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.630 line:0%
Shall we start the interrogation now?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:09.960 line:0%
If you want to ask or interrogate,

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:10.840 line:0%
just go ahead.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:11.680 line:0%
Shut up.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.280 line:0%
Madam.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.720 line:0%
How's the interrogation going?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:23.840 line:0%
Madam, you're finally here.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.640 line:0%
We've been waiting for you.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.520 line:0%
Even if she crawled here, she should have arrived by now.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.650 line:0%
Hurry up and start the interrogation.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.600 line:0%
You thought

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.200 line:0%
after Han Shiyuan eloped,

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.440 line:0%
he wouldn't appear again,

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.920 line:0%
so you fabricated his presence

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.720 line:0%
to frame him for the murder?

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.800 line:0%
Yes.

00:06:58.570 --> 00:06:59.630 line:0%
That's right.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.270 line:0%
Shiyuan said

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.680 line:0%
he'd elope with his lover on the night of the sixth.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.010 line:0%
I didn't mean to harm Shiyuan.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.360 line:0%
I knew he was leaving.

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.230 line:0%
I just wanted to use his name.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.480 line:0%
But this doesn't seem to be

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.210 line:0%
your motive for murder, right?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.010 line:0%
Everything you said is about Han Shiyuan,

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:18.840 line:0%
yet you never mentioned a word about

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.520 line:0%
that student you killed.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.090 line:0%
You still haven't told me

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.140 line:0%
why you committed that murder.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:27.760 line:0%
He?

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.560 line:0%
What's there to say about him?

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.240 line:0%
He damaged my poetry collection.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:32.720 line:0%
Didn't he deserve to die?

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.400 line:0%
Just because

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.240 line:0%
he damaged your poetry collection,

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.970 line:0%
you killed your own classmate?

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.530 line:0%
That poetry collection was very important to me.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.620 line:0%
Shiyuan

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.180 line:0%
was my only friend.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.140 line:0%
[Han Shiyuan]

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.640 line:0%
After Shiyuan and Yan Caiwei

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:01.680 line:0%
started dating,

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.360 line:0%
I stayed up many nights

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.180 line:0%
to copy that poetry collection.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.500 line:0%
It was my gift to Shiyuan.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:11.920 line:0%
My poetry collection!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.560 line:0%
It was just a copied, worthless poetry collection.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.290 line:0%
Do you think you're Pan Yanzhi?

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.130 line:0%
You think this crappy poetry collection

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.040 line:0%
would actually be

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.400 line:0%
treasured by someone?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.060 line:0%
Just a stack of waste paper.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.240 line:0%
My poetry collection.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.340 line:0%
How dare he destroy it?

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:52.060 line:0%
And he even dared to mock me.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.800 line:0%
You committed murder

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.660 line:0%
and deliberately framed Han Shiyuan for it.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.460 line:0%
Actually,

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:00.480 line:0%
deep down, you were hoping for him

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.410 line:0%
to come back when he heard the news.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.920 line:0%
After Han Shiyuan returned to Xiang'an,

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:04.880 line:0%
he disappeared.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.360 line:0%
Have you seen him?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.800 line:0%
Where did you hide Han Shiyuan?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.030 line:0%
In an abandoned winery warehouse

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.450 line:0%
in the West Market.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:51.890 line:0%
[The items displayed are all props made by the crew. No animals were harmed in the making of this drama.]

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.470 line:0%
That Lan Guizhou

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:49.920 line:0%
actually comes here regularly

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.080 line:0%
to torture and kill animals.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.520 line:0%
His mind is so twisted.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.620 line:0%
No wonder he would develop the evil intention to kill

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.420 line:0%
because of a poetry collection.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.760 line:0%
Han Shiyuan

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.440 line:0%
has been snatched away again.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.240 line:0%
It's a signal sent by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.170 line:0%
In the direction of Furong Garden.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:12.540 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:13.720 line:0%
Can't you just let me

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:15.390 line:0%
sit properly on the horse?

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:27.690 line:0%
[Furong Garden]

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:38.800 line:0%
Hand.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.240 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:51.000 line:0%
My legs are a bit numb.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.200 line:0%
Can you help me down?

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.780 line:0%
So stubborn.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.590 line:0%
Don't try to be a hero again.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:36.720 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.980 line:0%
Hurry up and save them.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:05.630 line:0%
I...

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.660 line:0%
My third sister is up there.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.450 line:0%
Quickly, send the Imperial Guards to put out the fire and save her.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.650 line:0%
The case is abnormal.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:11.880 line:0%
We can't act rashly.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.890 line:0%
White Ghost, maybe you can disregard human life,

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:16.870 line:0%
but I can't.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:19.240 line:0%
If you won't save them, I will.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.390 line:0%
Don't go over there.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.530 line:0%
Watch out!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.490 line:0%
It's the Cold Flame.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:57.980 line:0%
Here she comes.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.840 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.310 line:0%
[Chen Huo'e]

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.460 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.350 line:0%
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.030 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.480 line:0%
Fools of the world.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.990 line:0%
I, Chen Huo'e,

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.420 line:0%
have returned!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.910 line:0%
Chen Huo'e?

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.890 line:0%
The serial killer from five years ago.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.940 line:0%
Didn't she

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.910 line:0%
commit suicide in public five years ago?

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.650 line:0%
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.730 line:0%
Being so secretive and underhanded.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:30.970 line:0%
It must be a cover-up.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.360 line:0%
To think that someone,

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.820 line:0%
facing the Nirvana formation of my rebirth,

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.810 line:0%
could remain so calm and composed.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.900 line:0%
As expected from you, White Ghost.

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:42.390 line:0%
Alas,

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.740 line:0%
even if

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.860 line:0%
you are a soul-reaping ghost official,

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.670 line:0%
you cannot stop me, Chen Huo'e,

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:49.260 line:0%
from being reborn.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.890 line:0%
Then I shall capture you, evil spirit,

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.790 line:0%
and send you back to hell.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.080 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.410 line:0%
Sister Caiwei.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.140 line:0%
Han.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.230 line:0%
Sister Caiwei.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:24.730 line:0%
Xing.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.200 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.260 line:0%
Administer Yang, you're here.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:30.660 line:0%
It seems that

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.920 line:0%
Princess Yong'an will be the one

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.580 line:0%
inquiring about this matter.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:41.440 line:0%
However, the Grand Empress Dowager's

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.370 line:0%
Qianniu Guards also got involved.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:46.280 line:0%
It's indeed

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.840 line:0%
a bit perplexing.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.400 line:0%
This...

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.520 line:0%
Prince Ying

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.100 line:0%
only ordered me to save Mr. Han.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:53.960 line:0%
As for the rest,

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.170 line:0%
I don't know either.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:04.880 line:0%
Grand Commander. Administer Yang.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.560 line:0%
I was in a haste to save them. I apologize for my abruptness.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.680 line:0%
I hope I haven't interrupted your business.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:09.480 line:0%
No wonder

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:09.960 line:0%
you managed to mobilize

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.040 line:0%
the sword-bearing Qianniu Guards serving the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:12.680 line:0%
So it's you,

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.810 line:0%
the favored one by the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.140 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:19.510 line:0%
Shiyuan.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:20.880 line:0%
You...

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:23.880 line:0%
How did you end up like this?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:24.680 line:0%
Are you hurt?

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.610 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.130 line:0%
Never mind, never mind.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.690 line:0%
As long as you're safe.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.460 line:0%
You must remember

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.280 line:0%
to be more careful in the future.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:43.960 line:0%
Don't let yourself

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.890 line:0%
get into such a predicament again.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.240 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.160 line:0%
What happened today was unusual.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.980 line:0%
Fortunately, you were here.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.520 line:0%
Please ask the Imperial Security Bureau

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.890 line:0%
to pay more attention to this matter in the future.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:03.720 line:0%
You must catch

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.149 line:0%
the mastermind behind this

00:17:05.149 --> 00:17:06.610 line:0%
to avoid future troubles.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.149 line:0%
This matter was originally

00:17:13.149 --> 00:17:15.960 line:0%
the responsibility of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.690 line:0%
If you two hadn't been so hasty,

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.960 line:0%
the culprit would have already been brought to justice.

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.360 line:0%
In the heat of the moment,

00:17:22.649 --> 00:17:24.180 line:0%
we may have caused offense.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.149 line:0%
I hope you can forgive us, Grand Commander.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.720 line:0%
The reappearance of Chen Huo'e

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.790 line:0%
is quite odd.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.300 line:0%
As for catching the culprit,

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:35.700 line:0%
we'll have to rely on you, Grand Commander.

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:51.110 line:0%
I have to return to the palace and get back to my duties.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.370 line:0%
I'll take my leave now.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:17:59.360 line:0%
Han Shiyuan.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.150 line:0%
Her Highness asked me to relay a message to you.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.640 line:0%
As long as you're willing, Mr. Han,

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.360 line:0%
Her Highness's feelings haven't changed.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:17.440 line:0%
Han Shiyuan.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.330 line:0%
About tonight's events,

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.720 line:0%
do you have anything you want to say?

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.810 line:0%
I know nothing about it.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.190 line:0%
Regarding the case of the murdered student of Hongwen Academy,

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.200 line:0%
Xing has already

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.520 line:0%
cleared you of suspicion.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:30.320 line:0%
Tonight,

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.570 line:0%
you and Yan Caiwei are victims.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:34.430 line:0%
If you have nothing else to say,

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.590 line:0%
hurry up and take her back

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.400 line:0%
to Yan's Mansion to recover.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:52.010 line:0%
[Furong Garden]

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.860 line:0%
This third brother-in-law of yours

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.240 line:0%
surprisingly has close relationships

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.040 line:0%
with both Princess Yong'an

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.240 line:0%
and Zhang Baohuan.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.680 line:0%
It's quite unexpected.

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:02.640 line:0%
Indeed.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.640 line:0%
Obviously, Han Shiyuan and Zhang Baohuan

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.480 line:0%
have known each other for a long time.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:09.280 line:0%
He also has quite a history with Princess Yong'an.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.240 line:0%
But now that they saved him,

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.900 line:0%
he showed no gratitude at all.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.400 line:0%
If he could, he would even pretend not to know them.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.130 line:0%
There must be a reason for this.

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.760 line:0%
But my third sister

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.000 line:0%
seems to genuinely

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.260 line:0%
know nothing about it.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:29.720 line:0%
I know.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.850 line:0%
From the beginning,

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:35.120 line:0%
I never intended

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:37.780 line:0%
to make things difficult for your third sister.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.190 line:0%
Sorry for

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.590 line:0%
being rash just now.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:11.920 line:0%
Later, I'll go

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.040 line:0%
to the Ministry of Justice to check the case files.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:14.840 line:0%
Do you...

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.150 line:0%
want to come along?

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:21.440 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:23.270 line:0%
I'll go.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:33.180 line:0%
[Furong Garden]

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.320 line:0%
Come on, guys.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.380 line:0%
Put two inside.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:58.760 line:0%
And place two more here.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:20:59.480 line:0%
By the door.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.920 line:0%
Put two at each side of the door.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.960 line:0%
Make sure all the lanterns are aligned.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:05.020 line:0%
Light it up well for Grand Commander.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:06.640 line:0%
Clear out.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.840 line:0%
Isn't this a bit over the top?

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:25.160 line:0%
You put up so many lanterns.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.680 line:0%
As if candles were free.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:35.890 line:0%
[Case File for Chen Huo'e's Multiple Murders in Several Locations]

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:39.680 line:0%
Found it.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.240 line:0%
Five years ago,

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:47.760 line:0%
the notorious Chen Huo'e committed crimes in multiple locations.

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:49.750 line:0%
[Case File for Chen Huo'e's Multiple Murders in Several Locations]

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:48.780 line:0%
She consecutively murdered

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.140 line:0%
over 50 women.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.900 line:0%
And on the back of each deceased woman,

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.390 line:0%
there was

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:55.520 line:0%
a giant

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.070 line:0%
fire-scorched moth mark.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.160 line:0%
The entire nation was gripped by panic.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:00.280 line:0%
All families with daughters

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:02.680 line:0%
kept their doors closed and stayed inside.

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:06.280 line:0%
Eventually,

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:08.230 line:0%
the transgressor, Chen Huo'e,

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:09.720 line:0%
was captured by the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:10.400 line:0%
She turned out to be

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:12.330 line:0%
an ugly woman.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:15.000 line:0%
She arrogantly claimed

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.090 line:0%
that she knew the secret method of resurrection

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:18.750 line:0%
and would eventually return.

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:43.240 line:0%
Chen Huo'e drew her sword and severed her own heart vessels,

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:45.340 line:0%
and died at the arrest scene.

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:50.310 line:0%
Before she died,

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.130 line:0%
she left one last sentence.

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:53.910 line:0%
"Moths to a flame.

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:55.890 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk."

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:57.600 line:0%
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:22:57.600 --> 00:22:59.180 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation!

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:02.650 line:0%
Moths to a flame!

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.310 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk!

00:23:05.770 --> 00:23:07.570 line:0%
"Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:09.100 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation."

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:10.560 line:0%
Mrs. Tang?

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:16.320 line:0%
From the motives and methods

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:17.880 line:0%
of these two cases,

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:19.740 line:0%
they have no similarities at all.

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:24.610 line:0%
But judging by the case details alone,

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.090 line:0%
both of the two cases

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:28.490 line:0%
couldn't have been done by one person.

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:29.920 line:0%
So there's a gang.

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:31.000 line:0%
Whether it's

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.880 line:0%
Mrs. Tang's murder and burial,

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:34.000 line:0%
or the multiple murders

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.880 line:0%
committed by Chen Huo'e five years ago,

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:36.760 line:0%
or even

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:38.660 line:0%
tonight's mysterious act,

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:39.840 line:0%
the Nirvana formation,

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:40.640 line:0%
none of these could have been

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:41.880 line:0%
accomplished by one person.

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:43.930 line:0%
This isn't a simple gang operation.

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:46.600 line:0%
Just based on tonight's events,

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:48.800 line:0%
the relationships behind it are complex and intricate.

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:50.260 line:0%
I'm afraid this Chen Huo'e

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:52.310 line:0%
is also just a scapegoat.

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:55.430 line:0%
So is the Chen Huo'e who showed up tonight

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:57.280 line:0%
the same person as the one

00:23:57.300 --> 00:23:59.630 line:0%
who was brought to justice five years ago?

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:04.020 line:0%
Whether it's the same person or not,

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:06.920 line:0%
Chen Huo'e from five years ago

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.880 line:0%
disappeared after committing the crime.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.040 line:0%
It indicates that the person behind it

00:24:10.040 --> 00:24:11.360 line:0%
no longer needed her.

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:12.480 line:0%
However, five years later,

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:14.120 line:0%
Chen Huo'e appeared again,

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:16.680 line:0%
implying this person behind the scenes

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:18.730 line:0%
has needs again.

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:20.740 line:0%
Indeed.

00:24:22.610 --> 00:24:25.150 line:0%
What exactly does he want?

00:24:27.350 --> 00:24:29.790 line:0%
The situation behind this is complex and intricate.

00:24:29.790 --> 00:24:30.870 line:0%
A small mistake

00:24:31.920 --> 00:24:33.650 line:0%
could lead to a major disaster.

00:24:41.280 --> 00:24:42.310 line:0%
Mother.

00:24:43.110 --> 00:24:45.520 line:0%
The night-blooming jasmine in the backyard has blossomed.

00:24:45.520 --> 00:24:46.360 line:0%
I picked a bouquet

00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:47.890 line:0%
and brought it here for you.

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.220 line:0%
Now that you're alone over there,

00:24:51.230 --> 00:24:53.260 line:0%
do you feel lonely?

00:24:55.210 --> 00:24:56.340 line:0%
How about

00:24:56.860 --> 00:24:58.890 line:0%
I sing a song for you?

00:24:59.840 --> 00:25:01.310 line:0%
Do you remember

00:25:01.360 --> 00:25:02.440 line:0%
the lullaby you used to sing to me

00:25:02.440 --> 00:25:03.480 line:0%
when I was little?

00:25:05.180 --> 00:25:08.170 line:0%
♫Speak not in vain♫

00:25:08.440 --> 00:25:11.880 line:0%
♫Grandma scolds♫

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:18.840 line:0%
♫Mother picks flowers endlessly♫

00:25:19.680 --> 00:25:26.400 line:0%
♫Father listens to music with joy♫

00:25:26.520 --> 00:25:30.290 line:0%
♫Mother picks flowers endlessly♫

00:25:30.650 --> 00:25:31.450 line:0%
Who's there?

00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:39.370 line:0%
It's the first time

00:25:39.490 --> 00:25:42.720 line:0%
I've heard someone singing nursery rhymes in a graveyard.

00:25:42.720 --> 00:25:44.320 line:0%
On this dark and windy night,

00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:46.360 line:0%
it's quite intriguing.

00:25:48.670 --> 00:25:50.190 line:0%
Oh, it's you.

00:25:51.710 --> 00:25:53.570 line:0%
Ghost Face, I've seen you before.

00:25:55.640 --> 00:25:56.560 line:0%
When I came to visit

00:25:56.560 --> 00:25:57.640 line:0%
my mother,

00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:59.360 line:0%
I often saw you around here.

00:26:03.360 --> 00:26:05.690 line:0%
Do you also have relatives buried nearby?

00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:07.600 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:08.840 --> 00:26:09.960 line:0%
My mother

00:26:10.440 --> 00:26:11.760 line:0%
is buried near here.

00:26:16.920 --> 00:26:18.080 line:0%
I had no idea

00:26:18.080 --> 00:26:18.800 line:0%
there were

00:26:18.800 --> 00:26:20.800 line:0%
other families' tombs in this area.

00:26:23.280 --> 00:26:25.960 line:0%
The auspicious burial grounds near Xiang'an City

00:26:25.960 --> 00:26:27.280 line:0%
have certainly been bought up

00:26:27.280 --> 00:26:28.730 line:0%
by noble families

00:26:28.840 --> 00:26:31.360 line:0%
and wealthy households for their final resting places.

00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:32.600 line:0%
Nameless spirits

00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:33.720 line:0%
can only curl up

00:26:33.720 --> 00:26:35.450 line:0%
in the corners of the cemetery,

00:26:36.210 --> 00:26:37.290 line:0%
begging for

00:26:38.480 --> 00:26:40.280 line:0%
an underground dwelling place.

00:26:43.720 --> 00:26:48.170 line:0%
[Tomb of Beloved Wife Wang Ruohan]

00:26:45.440 --> 00:26:46.560 line:0%
This burial plot

00:26:46.580 --> 00:26:47.960 line:0%
did cost my father

00:26:47.960 --> 00:26:49.000 line:0%
a fortune.

00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:51.500 line:0%
It's indeed very large and grand.

00:26:51.520 --> 00:26:52.560 line:0%
But I know

00:26:52.560 --> 00:26:53.360 line:0%
my mother

00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:54.520 line:0%
wouldn't want to be all alone

00:26:54.520 --> 00:26:55.840 line:0%
here by herself.

00:26:55.960 --> 00:26:56.760 line:0%
She must also hope

00:26:56.760 --> 00:26:57.960 line:0%
to make more friends.

00:26:58.330 --> 00:26:59.470 line:0%
So I guess

00:26:59.640 --> 00:27:01.920 line:0%
my mother and your mother

00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:02.680 line:0%
must have already become

00:27:02.680 --> 00:27:04.940 line:0%
good neighbors and friends, Ghost Face.

00:27:08.220 --> 00:27:09.300 line:0%
Good friends?

00:27:16.640 --> 00:27:18.000 line:0%
You are

00:27:20.640 --> 00:27:21.840 line:0%
somewhat different.

00:27:34.970 --> 00:27:37.160 line:0%
Why do you wear a mask?

00:27:38.330 --> 00:27:40.900 line:0%
Is it because your face is injured?

00:27:47.270 --> 00:27:48.610 line:0%
Since I was born,

00:27:49.480 --> 00:27:51.540 line:0%
I've had an ugly birthmark on my face.

00:27:51.540 --> 00:27:52.990 line:0%
Its shape is terrifying.

00:27:53.390 --> 00:27:55.110 line:0%
Those who have seen my face

00:27:55.320 --> 00:27:58.380 line:0%
are all frightened into having recurring nightmares.

00:28:00.340 --> 00:28:01.700 line:0%
Do you want to see it?

00:28:03.490 --> 00:28:04.680 line:0%
Just a moment.

00:28:04.830 --> 00:28:06.630 line:0%
Let me prepare myself mentally.

00:28:07.070 --> 00:28:09.220 line:0%
Can you wait while I count to five?

00:28:09.960 --> 00:28:10.760 line:0%
Five.

00:28:11.560 --> 00:28:12.360 line:0%
Four.

00:28:12.840 --> 00:28:13.730 line:0%
Three.

00:28:14.240 --> 00:28:15.150 line:0%
Two.

00:28:15.640 --> 00:28:16.580 line:0%
One.

00:28:21.380 --> 00:28:22.380 line:0%
Ghost Face?

00:28:26.200 --> 00:28:27.260 line:0%
He's left already?

00:29:06.750 --> 00:29:08.780 line:0%
Your hand hasn't been treated yet.

00:29:09.040 --> 00:29:10.200 line:0%
I asked Butler Shen

00:29:10.200 --> 00:29:11.480 line:0%
to bring all kinds of ointments

00:29:11.480 --> 00:29:12.600 line:0%
from the mansion.

00:29:13.540 --> 00:29:16.200 line:0%
Let's see which one is best for treating this...

00:29:18.830 --> 00:29:19.930 line:0%
Bite wound.

00:29:37.890 --> 00:29:39.420 line:0%
How did it get so serious?

00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:42.200 line:0%
I was bitten by a puppy.

00:29:43.840 --> 00:29:45.100 line:0%
It's nothing serious.

00:29:51.170 --> 00:29:52.240 line:0%
Butler Shen said

00:29:52.240 --> 00:29:53.540 line:0%
there's a kind of red ointment

00:29:53.540 --> 00:29:54.990 line:0%
that Yaya used before.

00:29:58.080 --> 00:29:59.360 line:0%
Being bitten by Yaya

00:29:59.380 --> 00:30:01.800 line:0%
should be similar

00:30:04.430 --> 00:30:05.750 line:0%
to being bitten by me.

00:30:13.090 --> 00:30:14.280 line:0%
Indeed.

00:30:15.760 --> 00:30:16.480 line:0%
Previously, Yaya

00:30:16.480 --> 00:30:18.080 line:0%
was bitten by a crazy dog.

00:30:18.700 --> 00:30:19.900 line:0%
It's indeed similar.

00:31:46.370 --> 00:31:48.510 line:0%
Is this your way of apologizing?

00:31:51.540 --> 00:31:53.100 line:0%
Why should I apologize?

00:31:54.660 --> 00:31:56.120 line:0%
It was because you didn't make yourself clear

00:31:56.120 --> 00:31:57.580 line:0%
that I misunderstood you.

00:31:58.520 --> 00:31:59.400 line:0%
Besides,

00:31:59.420 --> 00:32:00.440 line:0%
it's already been hours since you got injured tonight.

00:32:00.440 --> 00:32:00.840 line:0%
Why didn't you have

00:32:00.840 --> 00:32:02.080 line:0%
Jing Lin bandage it?

00:32:02.080 --> 00:32:03.400 line:0%
Why did you have to wait for me?

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:03.960 line:0%
I...

00:32:33.510 --> 00:32:35.070 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:32:35.100 --> 00:32:35.680 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:35.680 --> 00:32:36.920 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:32:36.950 --> 00:32:38.180 line:0%
Let go!

00:32:38.250 --> 00:32:39.250 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:39.680 --> 00:32:41.300 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:32:46.560 --> 00:32:47.360 line:0%
Du.

00:32:47.740 --> 00:32:48.990 line:0%
Even though you did that to save her,

00:32:48.990 --> 00:32:50.590 line:0%
you still need to be careful.

00:32:50.790 --> 00:32:52.230 line:0%
If that arrow just now

00:32:52.250 --> 00:32:53.560 line:0%
had been an inch higher,

00:32:53.560 --> 00:32:55.120 line:0%
this person would have certainly died.

00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:55.800 line:0%
Father,

00:32:55.820 --> 00:32:57.180 line:0%
I won't miss my shot.

00:32:57.210 --> 00:32:58.360 line:0%
We still need to keep him alive

00:32:58.360 --> 00:32:59.680 line:0%
for interrogation.

00:33:04.460 --> 00:33:05.640 line:0%
My name is Shen Du.

00:33:06.150 --> 00:33:07.350 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:33:07.980 --> 00:33:09.020 line:0%
Are you still

00:33:09.900 --> 00:33:11.320 line:0%
that boy I remember,

00:33:11.320 --> 00:33:13.720 line:0%
descending from the heavens like a divine soldier?

00:33:13.720 --> 00:33:14.520 line:0%
Who's that?

00:33:15.360 --> 00:33:16.360 line:0%
Yan Xing!

00:33:55.840 --> 00:33:57.760 line:0%
W-What? How could this be?

00:33:59.580 --> 00:34:01.280 line:0%
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

00:34:01.280 --> 00:34:02.770 line:0%
Of course not.

00:34:20.760 --> 00:34:22.600 line:0%
I'm sorry. I grabbed the wrong one.

00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:24.370 line:0%
[Jinchuang Powder] [Jinhuang Powder]

00:34:27.680 --> 00:34:28.470 line:0%
You...

00:34:28.590 --> 00:34:30.519 line:0%
I'll wash it off for you right away.

00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:48.479 line:0%
♫The night is still young, and the moonlight reflects on the west window♫

00:34:49.850 --> 00:34:52.539 line:0%
♫There are stars in your eyes♫

00:34:53.519 --> 00:34:54.709 line:0%
♫When I touch you♫

00:34:55.430 --> 00:34:58.530 line:0%
♫My heart is like a flickering candlelight, shaking and swaying♫

00:34:59.940 --> 00:35:04.430 line:0%
♫The more I care, the deeper I hide♫

00:35:05.400 --> 00:35:09.980 line:0%
♫Leaves turn yellow and fall, and my thoughts run in thousands of lines♫

00:35:10.740 --> 00:35:13.880 line:0%
♫Time is like a poem, romantic and sorrowful♫

00:35:14.470 --> 00:35:16.190 line:0%
♫Two hearts♫

00:35:16.930 --> 00:35:20.110 line:0%
♫Collide between dawn and dusk♫

00:35:20.780 --> 00:35:25.060 line:0%
♫The embrace came as a surprise♫

00:35:26.280 --> 00:35:28.900 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:29.260 --> 00:35:32.440 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:35:33.250 --> 00:35:36.540 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:35:33.650 --> 00:35:34.410 line:0%
Stay still.

00:35:35.030 --> 00:35:35.950 line:0%
Don't move.

00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:39.490 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:35:39.980 --> 00:35:43.470 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:35:43.790 --> 00:35:45.920 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:35:46.540 --> 00:35:49.670 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:35:50.580 --> 00:35:53.170 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:52.220 --> 00:35:53.620 line:0%
You clearly did it on purpose.

00:35:53.620 --> 00:35:56.900 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:35:57.700 --> 00:36:00.900 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:36:01.320 --> 00:36:03.960 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:36:04.520 --> 00:36:07.520 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:36:07.820 --> 00:36:10.210 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:36:10.810 --> 00:36:14.640 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:36:22.080 --> 00:36:22.880 line:0%
My Lord.

00:36:24.800 --> 00:36:26.280 line:0%
Come on, Xing.

00:36:26.420 --> 00:36:27.870 line:0%
Sit down and have some tea.

00:36:27.870 --> 00:36:29.130 line:0%
Let's chat for a while.

00:36:29.600 --> 00:36:32.110 line:0%
What new rumors are there about me now?

00:36:32.160 --> 00:36:33.760 line:0%
There aren't any, really.

00:36:33.780 --> 00:36:34.910 line:0%
There are no rumors.

00:36:35.370 --> 00:36:36.830 line:0%
Isn't that right, My Lord?

00:36:36.850 --> 00:36:38.030 line:0%
It's just that

00:36:38.320 --> 00:36:39.480 line:0%
all of us

00:36:39.480 --> 00:36:40.320 line:0%
unanimously agree that

00:36:40.320 --> 00:36:43.050 line:0%
there's a dominatrix in our Ministry of Justice.

00:36:44.040 --> 00:36:45.490 line:0%
And this dominatrix

00:36:45.520 --> 00:36:46.980 line:0%
is extremely formidable.

00:36:48.080 --> 00:36:50.520 line:0%
She even dared to yell at White Ghost.

00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:52.840 line:0%
Unfortunately,

00:36:52.840 --> 00:36:53.760 line:0%
in the end,

00:36:53.800 --> 00:36:55.280 line:0%
she got

00:36:55.320 --> 00:36:56.710 line:0%
hung upside down on a horse

00:36:56.710 --> 00:36:59.450 line:0%
and paraded through the streets by the White Ghost.

00:36:59.450 --> 00:37:01.080 line:0%
As for women,

00:37:02.330 --> 00:37:03.590 line:0%
it's best for them to be

00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:04.440 line:0%
gentle,

00:37:04.440 --> 00:37:04.920 line:0%
kind,

00:37:04.920 --> 00:37:05.360 line:0%
courteous,

00:37:05.360 --> 00:37:06.040 line:0%
frugal,

00:37:06.040 --> 00:37:06.600 line:0%
and

00:37:08.810 --> 00:37:10.310 line:0%
yielding.

00:37:13.950 --> 00:37:15.430 line:0%
Lu Chuichui!

00:37:19.090 --> 00:37:20.420 line:0%
You're late again.

00:37:20.680 --> 00:37:21.600 line:0%
Not only are you late,

00:37:21.600 --> 00:37:23.080 line:0%
but you also look gloomy.

00:37:23.540 --> 00:37:25.010 line:0%
What were you up to yesterday?

00:37:25.010 --> 00:37:26.250 line:0%
Nothing much.

00:37:28.180 --> 00:37:29.840 line:0%
What kind of attitude is this?

00:37:34.400 --> 00:37:35.200 line:0%
Feng Gui.

00:37:37.600 --> 00:37:38.400 line:0%
My Lord.

00:37:39.200 --> 00:37:42.760 line:0%
Chen Huo'e was resurrected last night.

00:37:48.450 --> 00:37:49.610 line:0%
The Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:37:49.610 --> 00:37:50.440 line:0%
had someone deliver the case file here

00:37:50.440 --> 00:37:51.640 line:0%
early this morning,

00:37:51.640 --> 00:37:53.330 line:0%
indicating this case...

00:37:53.360 --> 00:37:54.320 line:0%
On my way in,

00:37:54.440 --> 00:37:55.960 line:0%
Ji Fangming, who's in charge of receiving and reviewing case files,

00:37:55.960 --> 00:37:57.200 line:0%
gave this to me.

00:37:57.200 --> 00:37:57.440 line:0%
Give it to me.

00:37:57.440 --> 00:37:58.200 line:0%
It's said to be a case that was submitted

00:37:58.200 --> 00:37:59.320 line:0%
by Wannian County.

00:38:04.920 --> 00:38:07.120 line:0%
At Xuanping Pavilion in Wannian County,

00:38:07.120 --> 00:38:08.770 line:0%
a murder case occurred.

00:38:09.050 --> 00:38:10.740 line:0%
The victim was the wife of

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:12.520 line:0%
a former official who had resigned and returned home,

00:38:12.520 --> 00:38:14.030 line:0%
Chen Shoujie.

00:38:14.050 --> 00:38:16.720 line:0%
Making a fuss over a woman's death.

00:38:17.370 --> 00:38:18.920 line:0%
According to you, Director Wu,

00:38:18.920 --> 00:38:20.280 line:0%
could it be that only men's lives and deaths

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:21.320 line:0%
matter?

00:38:21.440 --> 00:38:22.680 line:0%
Are women's lives

00:38:22.760 --> 00:38:24.320 line:0%
not worthy of attention?

00:38:27.560 --> 00:38:29.000 line:0%
What did I say?

00:38:31.000 --> 00:38:32.320 line:0%
You married into the Shen family,

00:38:32.320 --> 00:38:34.380 line:0%
and your temper has grown, hasn't it?

00:38:34.880 --> 00:38:35.900 line:0%
Fine.

00:38:40.800 --> 00:38:41.960 line:0%
Forget I said anything.

00:38:41.960 --> 00:38:42.760 line:0%
Feng Gui.

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:45.280 line:0%
Arrange for the constables to investigate.

00:38:45.280 --> 00:38:46.840 line:0%
My Lord. My Lord.

00:38:47.080 --> 00:38:48.720 line:0%
The coroner's report states

00:38:48.720 --> 00:38:50.840 line:0%
the victim was probably killed last night.

00:38:50.840 --> 00:38:52.570 line:0%
There appeared on her shoulder

00:38:52.680 --> 00:38:54.650 line:0%
a giant fire-scorched moth.

00:38:54.960 --> 00:38:56.160 line:0%
It's exactly the same

00:38:56.520 --> 00:38:59.080 line:0%
as the marks

00:38:57.290 --> 00:38:59.540 line:0%
[Chen Shoujie's Confession]

00:38:59.080 --> 00:39:00.400 line:0%
left on those victims

00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:01.000 line:0%
from Chen Huo'e murder cases from five years ago.

00:39:01.000 --> 00:39:02.360 line:0%
It's Chen Huo'e again.

00:39:03.210 --> 00:39:04.210 line:0%
Director Wu.

00:39:05.050 --> 00:39:07.440 line:0%
Please allow me to participate in the investigation of this case.

00:39:07.440 --> 00:39:08.800 line:0%
Since this matter is related to the case of

00:39:08.800 --> 00:39:10.040 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's resurrection,

00:39:10.040 --> 00:39:11.120 line:0%
it should be handed over to the Imperial Security Bureau

00:39:11.120 --> 00:39:11.960 line:0%
to be handled together.

00:39:11.960 --> 00:39:12.760 line:0%
That's right.

00:39:13.080 --> 00:39:14.720 line:0%
It's inappropriate for our Ministry of Justice

00:39:14.720 --> 00:39:15.330 line:0%
[File of Chen Shoujie's Wife's Case]

00:39:14.840 --> 00:39:15.700 line:0%
to get involved.

00:39:15.700 --> 00:39:17.700 line:0%
Right, right. It's inappropriate.

00:39:21.940 --> 00:39:24.540 line:0%
Although the Grand Commander is your husband,

00:39:24.720 --> 00:39:26.320 line:0%
in the Shen family, you're just

00:39:26.320 --> 00:39:28.090 line:0%
someone who gets beaten up.

00:39:29.320 --> 00:39:30.320 line:0%
When the White Ghost solves cases,

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:31.600 line:0%
he won't take you along.

00:39:31.600 --> 00:39:32.900 line:0%
He won't.

00:39:33.800 --> 00:39:35.520 line:0%
Chief Censor has arrived.

00:39:38.310 --> 00:39:40.010 line:0%
Greetings, Lord Lai.

00:39:44.700 --> 00:39:45.620 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:39:52.700 --> 00:39:54.440 line:0%
Although the White Ghost is unwilling to take you along,

00:39:54.440 --> 00:39:55.560 line:0%
I, Black Rakshasa,

00:39:55.680 --> 00:39:57.940 line:0%
would very much like to invite Miss Yan

00:39:58.290 --> 00:40:00.620 line:0%
to assist in the investigation together.

00:40:02.280 --> 00:40:03.370 line:0%
Director Wu.

00:40:04.920 --> 00:40:05.920 line:0%
Five years ago,

00:40:06.040 --> 00:40:07.440 line:0%
I was the one responsible for investigating

00:40:07.440 --> 00:40:08.760 line:0%
the Chen Huo'e case.

00:40:17.950 --> 00:40:19.640 line:0%
I've experienced

00:40:19.660 --> 00:40:21.470 line:0%
Yan Xing's investigative methods.

00:40:21.470 --> 00:40:22.480 line:0%
Since you're also interested

00:40:22.480 --> 00:40:24.280 line:0%
in the Chen Huo'e case this time,

00:40:24.440 --> 00:40:25.200 line:0%
why don't you

00:40:25.200 --> 00:40:27.520 line:0%
come work at my Imperial Investigation Department?

00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:30.650 line:0%
You could help me catch the real culprit. What do you say?

00:40:38.010 --> 00:40:39.690 line:0%
Thank you for your kind offer, Lord Lai.

00:40:39.690 --> 00:40:41.840 line:0%
But I'm just a minor scribe in the Ministry of Justice.

00:40:41.840 --> 00:40:42.600 line:0%
I only hope that in the future,

00:40:42.600 --> 00:40:44.080 line:0%
I can participate in the selection for female officials

00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:45.800 line:0%
and pass the exam for the position of Document Secretary.

00:40:45.800 --> 00:40:48.330 line:0%
I have no plans to work at another department.

00:40:52.890 --> 00:40:55.690 line:0%
Since you refuse to accept my goodwill, Mrs. Shen,

00:40:56.160 --> 00:40:57.150 line:0%
then...

00:40:58.950 --> 00:41:00.610 line:0%
Let's meet again another day.

00:41:07.430 --> 00:41:08.910 line:0%
Take care, Lord Lai.

00:41:19.920 --> 00:41:20.980 line:0%
Stop the carriage.

00:41:24.680 --> 00:41:26.210 line:0%
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:41:26.800 --> 00:41:27.730 line:0%
Mr. Han.

00:41:28.760 --> 00:41:30.840 line:0%
It's been a while since we last met.

00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:32.710 line:0%
Now that we've run into each other today,

00:41:32.710 --> 00:41:34.630 line:0%
do you still plan to avoid me?

00:41:37.200 --> 00:41:38.660 line:0%
I dare not, Your Highness.

00:41:42.180 --> 00:41:44.310 line:0%
Mr. Han, what's that supposed to mean?

00:41:45.520 --> 00:41:46.800 line:0%
Stand up and answer me.

00:41:52.640 --> 00:41:53.860 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:41:54.130 --> 00:41:55.770 line:0%
I am but a humble commoner.

00:41:55.890 --> 00:41:58.150 line:0%
I fear I might offend you, Your Highness.

00:42:05.420 --> 00:42:07.620 line:0%
Mr. Han, why are you saying such things?

00:42:07.730 --> 00:42:08.840 line:0%
Matters of the heart

00:42:08.840 --> 00:42:10.200 line:0%
cannot be forced.

00:42:10.840 --> 00:42:11.920 line:0%
Since your heart

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:13.780 line:0%
already belongs to someone else,

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:16.650 line:0%
I shall gladly step aside for your happiness.

00:42:16.840 --> 00:42:20.700 line:0%
This humble one is deeply grateful for your kindness, Your Highness.

00:42:27.680 --> 00:42:28.480 line:0%
Let's go.

00:42:56.160 --> 00:42:56.960 line:0%
Your Highness.